.15.5585) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-8700K CPU @ 3.70GHz (12 threads)\r\n\r\n### Issue description\r\n\r\nWhen setting a FileDialog to native, it passes along the field called `filters` instead of `filter`. (Confusing variable naming here 😄)\r\n\r\nThe former is the raw array that the user passes, while the latter also translates filter descriptions and also includes entries like \"All Recognized\" and \"All Files\" which are auto-generated.\r\n\r\nWhen not using a native window, the auto-generated filter entries are included as expected.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b261897f-062b-4e0c-a4d5-8575e9736d3f)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5569b4c2-92f7-456e-baf6-a2295dbcdee2)\r\n\r\n### Steps to reproduce\r\n\r\n- Create FileDialog and enable \"Use Native Dialog\"\r\n- Add an entry to filters, it can be whatever\r\n- Popup the dialog and notice it does not have any auto-generated entries\r\n- Disable \"Use Native Dialog\", popup and you see it does have the entries as expected\r\n\r\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\r\n\r\nI don't have time to create a MRP right now, sorry! I'm mobile for over a week.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"http